android-ui-inspector
====================

This project implements the Android view-debug capture protocol and hit-testing
behavior that are also used by LayoutInspectorV2-Pro:

    https://github.com/CoXier/LayoutInspectorV2-Pro
    Copyright (C) 2017-2023 The Android Open Source Project / CoXier
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Protocol references:
  * android.view.ViewDebug / android.view.ViewHierarchyEncoder (AOSP, Apache-2.0)
  * android.ddm.DdmHandleViewDebug (AOSP, Apache-2.0)
  * com.android.ddmlib HandleViewDebug / DdmJdwpExtension (AOSP, Apache-2.0)

The implementation in this repository is independently written in TypeScript.
The Apache-2.0 license of the referenced projects applies to their respective
code, not to this repository. This repository is distributed under the MIT
License (see LICENSE).

Jetpack Compose inspection
--------------------------
The optional Compose tree source reuses the transport daemon, JVMTI agent, inspector jars,
and protobuf definitions shipped with a locally installed Android Studio, and the
androidx.compose.ui:ui-inspection inspector artifact from Google Maven. Those components
are part of the Android Open Source Project / AndroidX and are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. They are read from the user's installation at runtime and
are not redistributed by this project.
